In `checkIfIsAvailable` (packages/trpc/server/routers/viewer/slots.ts), the new working-hours validation computes both `start` and `end` from `slotStartTime`:
```ts
const start = slotStartTime.hour() * 60 + slotStartTime.minute();
const end = slotStartTime.hour() * 60 + slotStartTime.minute();
```
So `end` never reflects the slot’s actual end time (which depends on `eventLength` / `slotEndTime`). This makes the `end > workingHour.endTime` condition ineffective for detecting slots that start within working hours but extend beyond them (e.g., 16:45–17:15 vs. a 17:00 end). The finding matches the diff and indicates incorrect availability behavior.

